 "n": 8,
 "title": "Cover 2, 3 and 4: what the numbers mean",
 "html": "<p><strong>The number is how many defenders split up the deep part of the field.</strong> Not how many receivers are covered. It's the fastest way to name a coverage because the deep defenders are the ones you can see before the snap (Lesson 5's \"safeties\").</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cover 2: two deep, five underneath\"><defs><marker id=\"m20w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m20y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"190\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"185\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"20\" width=\"194\" height=\"72\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.26)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><t