t shown)</text></svg></div>\n<p><strong>Cover 2:</strong> two safeties each take a deep half. Five defenders cover short areas underneath. <em>Strong against</em> short throws, since there are lots of bodies near the line. <em>Soft spot:</em> the deep middle between the two safeties, about 15–20 yards downfield.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cover 3: three deep, four underneath\"><defs><marker id=\"m21w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m21y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"190\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"185\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"20\" width=\"128\" height=\"72\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.26)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"68.0\" y=\"33\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">deep third</text><rect x=\"136\" y=\"20\" width=\"128\" height=\"72\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.26)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"33\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">deep third</text><rect x=\"268\" y=\"20\" width=\"128\" height=\"72\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.26)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"/><text x=\"332.0\" y=\"33\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">deep third</text><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"60\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"68\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"60\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"332\" cy=\"60\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"332\" y=\"63.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"104\" width=\"94\" height=\"70\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.13)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"51.0\" y=\"117\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">flat</text><circle cx=\"51.0\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"51.0\" y=\"153.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><rec