ght=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"124\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">extra LB spies the middle</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"232\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Cover 1: man on every receiver, 1 safety deep (4 rushers not shown)</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Cover 1:</strong> man coverage (dashed ties) on every receiver, with one safety deep as backup.</p><div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cover 0: man coverage with no deep safety and extra blitzers\"><defs><marker id=\"m24w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m24y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"190\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"185\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"204\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"207.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><line x1=\"30\" x2=\"30\" y1=\"164\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"153.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><line x1=\"96\" x2=\"96\" y1=\"164\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><circle cx=\"96\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"96\" y=\"153.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">NB</text><line x1=\"304\" x2=\"304\" y1=\"164\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"153.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><line x1=\"370\" x2=\"370\" y1=\"164\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"153.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"123.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><path d=\"M150 132 L186.4 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#m24y)\"/><circle cx=\"176\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"123.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><path d=\"M176 132 L194.2 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#m24y)\"/><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"123.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><path d=\"M228 132 L209.8 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#m24y)\"/><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"254\" y=\"123.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><path d=\"M254 132 L217.6 180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" marker-end=\"url(#m24y)\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">nobody deep</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"62\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">one missed tackle = touchdown</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"232\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Cover 0: man on every receiver, everyone else blitzes</text></svg></div><p class=\"note\"><strong>Cover 0:</strong> man coverage with nobody deep, so everyone else can blitz. All or nothing.</p>\n<h3>How zone defenders keep track of receivers</h3>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 246\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two zone defenders passing a crossing receiver from one hook zone to the next, with hash marks and field numbers as boundaries\"><defs><marker id=\"m25w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m25y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"195\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><g stroke=\"rgba(255,255,255,.55)\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"24\" y2=\"30\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"44\" y2=\"50\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"64\" y2=\"70\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"84\" y2=\"90\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"104\" y2=\"110\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"124\" y2=\"130\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"144\" y2=\"150\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"164\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"160\" x2=\"160\" y1=\"184\" y2=\"190\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"24\" y2=\"30\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"44\" y2=\"50\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"64\" y2=\"70\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"84\" y2=\"90\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"104\" y2=\"110\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"124\" y2=\"130\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"144\" y2=\"150\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"164\" y2=\"170\"/><line x1=\"240\" x2=\"240\" y1=\"184\" y2=\"190\"/></g><text x=\"70\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.55)\">3 0</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.55)\">3 0</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">hash</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">hash</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">numbers</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"18\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">numbers</text><rect x=\"84\" y=\"110\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.13)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"139.0\" y=\"123\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">LB 1: hook zone</text><rect x=\"206\" y=\"110\" width=\"110\" height=\"70\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.13)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"261.0\" y=\"123\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">LB 2: hook zone</text><path d=\"M40 210 L60 150 L360 150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m25w)\"/><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"212\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"215.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"160\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"163.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><path d=\"M150 158 L186 154\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m25y)\"/><circle cx=\"260\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">LB</text><path d=\"M250 160 L226 154\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m25y)\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"102\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">\"Yours!\"</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"238\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Zones end at landmarks (hashes, numbers). LB 1 hands the crosser to LB 2.</text></svg></div>\n<ul class=\"tight\">\n<li><strong>Zones have edges, set by field markings.</strong> Each defender has \"landmarks\": a depth (for example, 10–12 yards for a short zone) and a width (for example, \"from the hash marks to the numbers painted on the field\"). He drops to that spot at the snap.</li>\n<li><strong>Eyes on the QB, not on receivers.</strong> Most zone defenders watch the QB and feel receivers entering their area. The QB's eyes and shoulders show where he's about to throw.</li>\n<li><strong>They pass receivers along.</strong> When a receiver leaves one zone and enters the next, the first defender shouts and releases him to the teammate who owns that area. That handoff is where miscommunication creates wide-open receivers.</li>\n<li><strong>Empty zone? Help next door.</strong> If nobody enters his area, he drifts toward the nearest receiver or the spot the QB is looking at.</li>\n<li><strong>Modern zones turn into man.</strong> Many teams play \"match\" coverage: it starts as zone, then once receivers declare their routes, each defender locks onto whoever is in his area. It combines zone's organization with man's tight coverage.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The offense's answer:</strong> send two receivers into one defender's zone at different depths. He can only cover one; the QB throws to the other. That's called \"flooding\" a zone.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 246\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A flood: two receivers run into one zone defender’s area at different depths\"><defs><marker id=\"m26w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m26y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"200\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"195\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"100\" width=\"140\" height=\"86\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"rgba(242,183,5,.13)\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><text x=\"320.0\" y=\"113\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#F2B705\">one defender’s zone</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"150\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"153.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"372\" cy=\"214\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"217.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"310\" cy=\"218\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"221.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">TE</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"236\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"239.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><path d=\"M372 202 L372 120 L352 116\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m26w)\"/><path d=\"M310 206 L330 176 L380 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m26w)\"/><path d=\"M194 228 L348 122\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m26w)\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"90\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">deep receiver</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"196\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">short receiver</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"60\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Two receivers enter ONE zone at</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"76\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">different depths. The defender can</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"92\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">only guard one. QB throws to the other.</text></svg></div>\n<p><strong>How to spot it on TV:</strong> count the deep defenders just before the snap: two means Cover 2 or 4, one means Cover 1 or 3, none means Cover 0. Defenses do disguise by moving safeties at the snap, so check the replay's wide angle.</p>",
